{"source": "寫手 program 階（writer/compose.py）的句式與槽（round4 § 6、§ 7.1、§ 7.2）：照 corpus 固化/04 槽填充模板、06 開場收尾句庫的寫法，只寫教室・文化祭收攤這一個場景；字句自擬，不抄評測題正解。by_detail 只放訓練用的小動作 ribbon——poster 故意不放（program 階跑它＝難例，等 train/optimize 的 distill 追加），lights 是 held-out 驗證題、永遠不放專屬句（只有 generic 接它）。每個槽是候選句的格（序號 key，id＝tpl.<路徑>，例 tpl.generic.open.01；uses＝這句用到的設定格，round4-data.md § 2.2），compose 照第 i 個角度（data/hints.json）挑第 i mod 格數個；by_detail 沒有的槽退回 generic。佔位：{place} 地點、{prop} 這題小動作的道具（scene.<場>.detail.<detail>.prop 的字面）、{heroine} 女角全名、{called} 主角叫她的稱呼。槽：open 開場旁白、lead 主角搭話、deny／yield／cover 給 tools/beat 的否認／讓步／遮掩、reveal 洩底旁白、lead2 主角回話、close 收尾旁白。人寫；訓練中 bytes 不變——distill 只追加到 templates.distilled.json（id 前綴 tpld.），compose 把它接在同槽人寫的後面",
 "_metainfo": {"summary": "寫手 program 階的模板句，一句一格", "kind": "data", "counter_cells": 39, "writers": ["author"], "readers": ["writer/compose.py"]},
 "scene": "教室收攤",
 "generic": {
  "open": {"01": {"text": "（文化祭閉幕後的{place}。夕陽從關不緊的窗斜進來。）", "uses": ["place.classroom.fact.02"]},
          "02": {"text": "（攤位拆完了，{place}一下子空得很安靜。）", "uses": ["scene.closeup.state.01"]},
          "03": {"text": "（走廊的喧鬧退去，{place}裡只剩兩個人。）", "uses": ["scene.closeup.state.02"]}},
  "lead": {"01": {"text": "主角：「{called}，剩下的我來收吧。」"},
          "02": {"text": "主角：「{called}，這個要怎麼處理？」"},
          "03": {"text": "主角：「累了吧，{called}。」"}},
  "deny": {"01": {"text": "才沒有捨不得", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.tic.03", "style.tsun.deny.02"]},
          "02": {"text": "哼，誰會在意這種事", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.tic.01", "style.tsun.deny.03"]},
          "03": {"text": "才不是想留下來", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.tic.02", "style.tsun.deny.01"]}},
  "yield": {"01": {"text": "也不是不能接受", "uses": ["style.tsun.yield.01", "style.tsun.yield.02"]},
           "02": {"text": "偶爾這樣也還算可以", "uses": ["style.tsun.yield.03", "style.tsun.yield.04"]},
           "03": {"text": "沒說不行就是了", "uses": ["style.tsun.yield.07"]}},
  "cover": {"01": {"text": "真是的", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.tic.04", "style.tsun.cover.01"]},
           "02": {"text": "只是剛好而已", "uses": ["style.tsun.cover.02"]},
           "03": {"text": "別、別誤會了", "uses": ["style.tsun.cover.04", "style.tsun.deny.04"]}},
  "reveal": {"01": {"text": "（{heroine}別過臉，耳根有點紅。）", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.gesture.01", "cast.yuzu.gesture.02", "style.tsun.reveal.01"]},
            "02": {"text": "（{heroine}把瀏海往耳後撥，眼神飄向窗外。）", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.gesture.03", "cast.yuzu.gesture.04"]},
            "03": {"text": "（{heroine}小聲說完，又偷瞄了這邊一眼。）", "uses": ["style.tsun.reveal.02", "style.tsun.reveal.05"]}},
  "lead2": {"01": {"text": "主角：「好好好，那就一起收吧。」"},
           "02": {"text": "主角：「是是是，我知道了。」"},
           "03": {"text": "主角：「嗯，那就這樣吧。」"}},
  "close": {"01": {"text": "（夕陽又往下沉了一點。）"},
           "02": {"text": "（{heroine}背起書包，在門口停了一下才走。）"},
           "03": {"text": "（誰也沒先說要走。）"}}},
 "by_detail": {
  "ribbon": {
   "open": {"01": {"text": "（{place}。{prop}從天花板垂下來，一半已經拆掉了。）", "uses": ["scene.closeup.prop.ribbon"], "by": "author"},
          "02": {"text": "（{place}。{heroine}踮著腳，把最後一段{prop}從天花板扯下來。）", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.gesture.05", "scene.closeup.prop.ribbon"], "by": "author"},
          "03": {"text": "（拆下來的{prop}堆在桌上，夕陽把它們照成同一種顏色。）", "uses": ["scene.closeup.prop.ribbon"], "by": "author"}},
   "lead": {"01": {"text": "主角：「{called}，那段{prop}不是要丟嗎？」", "uses": ["scene.closeup.prop.ribbon"], "by": "author"},
          "02": {"text": "主角：「{called}，{prop}捲那麼整齊做什麼？」", "uses": ["scene.closeup.prop.ribbon"], "by": "author"},
          "03": {"text": "主角：「{called}，那段要帶回去？」", "by": "author"}},
   "deny": {"01": {"text": "才不是要留著", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.tic.02", "style.tsun.deny.01"], "by": "author"},
          "02": {"text": "哼，只是順手捲起來而已", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.tic.01", "style.tsun.deny.03"], "by": "author"},
          "03": {"text": "才沒有想帶回去", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.tic.03", "style.tsun.deny.02"], "by": "author"}},
   "yield": {"01": {"text": "丟掉也不是不行", "uses": ["style.tsun.yield.02"], "by": "author"},
           "02": {"text": "也不是不能分你一段", "uses": ["style.tsun.yield.01", "style.tsun.yield.02"], "by": "author"},
           "03": {"text": "偶爾留個紀念還算可以", "uses": ["style.tsun.yield.03", "style.tsun.yield.04"], "by": "author"}},
   "reveal": {"01": {"text": "（{heroine}把捲好的一段{prop}塞進書包，耳根有點紅。）", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.gesture.02", "scene.closeup.prop.ribbon", "style.tsun.reveal.01"], "by": "author"},
            "02": {"text": "（{heroine}別過臉，手卻沒停，把{prop}捲得更緊。）", "uses": ["cast.yuzu.gesture.01", "scene.closeup.prop.ribbon", "style.tsun.reveal.03"], "by": "author"},
            "03": {"text": "（{heroine}小聲說完，把{prop}往書包裡又推了推。）", "uses": ["scene.closeup.prop.ribbon", "style.tsun.reveal.02"], "by": "author"}}}}}
